    "print(\"\"\"\n",
    "\\n\" + \"=\"*80)\n",
    "REDESIGNED NOTEBOOK SUMMARY\n",
    "=\"*80\n",
    "\n",
    "ARCHITECTURE CHANGES FROM ORIGINAL (15.38 RMSE):\n",
    "\n",
    "1. GEOLOGICAL SURFACE MODELING\n",
    "   - Created depth-to-surface features: Z_ANCC, Z_ASTNU, Z_ASTNL, Z_EGFDU, Z_EGFDL, Z_BUDA\n",
    "   - Added formation thickness features (surface-to-surface differences)\n",
    "   - These replace sole reliance on GR (which has 30% missing values)\n",
    "\n",
    "2. TVT TRAJECTORY LEARNING\n",
    "   - Learn from entire known TVT section, not just last 500 rows\n",
    "   - Extract: dTVT_mean, dTVT_std, dTVT_max, dTVT_min\n",
    "   - Extract: d2TVT (acceleration), TVT_slope_full, TVT_intercept_full\n",
    "   - Use ensemble of 4 extrapolation strategies (flat, slope_full, slope_500, adaptive)\n",
    "\n",
    "3. GR MULTI-SCALE CORRELATION\n",
    "   - Sliding window statistics: mean, std, max at windows 50, 100, 200\n",
    "   - GR gradient and gradient smoothing (rate of change)\n",
    "   - Cross-correlation with typewell GR\n",
    "   - Replaces simplistic GR matching with multi-scale analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "4. PREDICTION START (PS) INTELLIGENCE\n",
    "   - Explicit is_after_PS flag\n",
    "   - Distance from PS in MD and rows\n",
    "   - Normalized distance from PS (0-1 in eval zone)\n",
    "   - Treats PS boundary as meaningful geological feature\n",
    "\n",
    "5. RESIDUAL LEARNING ARCHITECTURE\n",
    "   - Baseline TVT = ensemble of geology-only predictions\n",
    "   - Train ML models on (y_true - y_baseline) residuals\n",
    "   - Final prediction = baseline + ML_correction\n",
    "   - Separates concerns: geology handles known patterns, ML fixes residuals\n",
    "\n",
    "6. ENSEMBLE ML LEARNERS\n",
    "   - CatBoost + LightGBM trained on residuals\n",
    "   - Models see: geological features + GR features + PS features + baseline predictions\n",
    "   - Predictions averaged across models\n",
    "   - Trained with GroupKFold validation (proper well-level cross-validation)\n",
    "\n",
    "7. SPATIAL GEOLOGY\n",
    "   - X, Y spatial coordinates\n",
    "   - Trajectory curvature and angle\n",
    "   - Foundation for future neighbor-well analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "VALIDATION APPROACH:\n",
    "   - GroupKFold (k=5) with group=well_id\n",
    "   - Never mixes wells between train/val folds\n",
    "   - Reports per-fold RMSE, mean, and std\n",
    "\n",
    "EXPECTED PERFORMANCE GAINS:\n",
    "\n",
    "   Original baseline (GR-only, last 500 rows): ~15.38 RMSE\n",
    "   Isolated geological features: ~12-13 RMSE (baseline alone)\n",
    "   + ML residual correction: ~6-8 RMSE (target: < 6)\n",
    "\n",
    "KEY DIFFERENTIATORS:\n",
    "\n",
    "   ✓ Uses ANCC, ASTNU, ASTNL, EGFDU, EGFDL, BUDA (not GR alone)\n",
    "   ✓ Models dTVT and d2TVT (differential TVT)\n",
    "   ✓ Learns from entire TVT trajectory\n",
    "   ✓ Residual ML framework (geology + correction)\n",
    "   ✓ Proper GroupKFold validation\n",
    "   ✓ Feature importance analysis\n",
    "   ✓ Hard well analysis (wells with high residual error)\n",
    "\n",
    "NEXT STEPS FOR FURTHER IMPROVEMENT:\n",
    "\n",
    "   1. Neighbor-well analysis: use nearby wells' geology patterns\n",
    "   2. Dynamic DTW alignment: implement true sequence alignment\n",
    "   3. Per-well hyperparameter tuning\n",
    "   4. Soft-DTW for differentiable alignment\n",
    "   5. Hard-well ensemble: separate models for hard vs easy wells\n",
    "   6. Interpolation-based feature enrichment for missing GR values\n",
    "   7. Formation boundary detection from derivatives\n",
    "   8. Well offset anomaly detection\n",
    "\"\"\")"}}
